{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_banner_smaller_2024.png?t=1740454865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Ten Thousand Coins: The Golden Merchant</strong></i> is a story-rich merchant strategy trading game where a forsaken fox merchant must trade, earn coins, and gather allies while hunted by powerful adversaries to find her lost mentor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Wilderness_Travel_-_Story_Mode_2.gif?t=1740454865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many years prior, while a Ravenn merchant trades in this war-ravaged land, he makes a shocking discovery and finds a mysterious little companion. His actions will determine the fate of those a decade later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_story.png?t=1740454865\" />Discover deep character-driven stories spanning two timelines. See your character decisions come to fruition between timelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Environment_-_Relic_City.gif?t=1740454865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_barter.png?t=1740454865\" />Enjoy turn-based merchant trading with time &amp; resource management and bartering goods directly with traders while balancing their moods and needs. Knowing what goods, and when to offer them is the key to a successful trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Barter_-_Lumber_Fyve.gif?t=1740454865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_banner_smaller_2024_cm.png?t=1740454865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In our Company Mode, play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company where you will rebuild a company building back to its former glory in this RPG and rogue-lite game mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Company_Mode.gif?t=1740454865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_combat.png?t=1740454865\" />Bandits and wild beasts are constantly eyeing your wagons. Experience turn-based combat with a merchant twist: each of your trading goods can be used for attacking or defending with its own unique effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Combat.gif?t=1740454865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, for a peaceful resolution, negotiate or intimidate your way out of a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_features.png?t=1740454865\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story Mode - An immersive and character-focused storyline spanning two timelines. Make impactful choices to craft your journey to the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Company Mode - Play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company and rebuild a rundown company building back to its former glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A crisp fully hand-drawn anime-inspired art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colourful characters, cities and settlements to explore, trade, and build a reputation with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of unique goods to discover, use, and trade with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and assemble various guards &amp; travellers and build your merchant convoy to aid you on your travels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random wilderness encounters to navigate through and challenging enemies to battle against.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/description_subtitle_wishlist.png?t=1740454865\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1157900?t=1740454865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1157900?t=1740454865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740454865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740454865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1322400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Visit our website!</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Sign_up_for_Alpha_295px.png?t=1740454865\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/Join_Discord_295px.png?t=1740454865\" /><br><strong>Visit our website!</strong> to join our Discord server and our <strong>Mailing List</strong> for a chance to become an Al